  "description": "An asynchronous, networked key-value store implemented using the tarpc RPC framework and tokio runtime. The system employs a thread-safe, in-memory HashMap protected by an Arc-Mutex for concurrent state management across TCP connections. It utilizes custom serde-based JSON serialization for request-response multiplexing over IPv6 loopback interfaces.",
